{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00011",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.23,
      "end_seconds": 6.62,
      "duration_seconds": 5.39,
      "text": "Hi there, um, is it alright if I come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.17,
      "end_seconds": 10.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "No trouble at all, come in. What's been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.06,
      "end_seconds": 19.39,
      "duration_seconds": 7.33,
      "text": "I'm here because of sneezing fits. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.84,
      "end_seconds": 24.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Okay, how long has this been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.41,
      "end_seconds": 37.21,
      "duration_seconds": 11.8,
      "text": "Yeah, it's been going on for about three months. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it. I just want to get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.23,
      "end_seconds": 47.11,
      "duration_seconds": 8.88,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse. Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.37,
      "end_seconds": 65.16,
      "duration_seconds": 16.79,
      "text": "Right, it's once or twice a day. I get some relief from antihistamines. About a four out of ten. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.91,
      "end_seconds": 70.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "So, does it come along with anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.19,
      "end_seconds": 73.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "It usually comes with a runny nose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.41,
      "end_seconds": 76.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Have you had a dry cough?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.48,
      "end_seconds": 84.02,
      "duration_seconds": 6.54,
      "text": "Yes, since yesterday. As for dry cough, I'd give it a six, out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.89,
      "end_seconds": 87.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "One moment, the system's being slow today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.15,
      "end_seconds": 89.08,
      "duration_seconds": 0.93,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.98,
      "end_seconds": 105.91,
      "duration_seconds": 5.93,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Let me check a few things. Any loss of smell or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.47,
      "end_seconds": 109.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "No. None of those, uh, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.78,
      "end_seconds": 112.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Mm. Has there been any facial pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.61,
      "end_seconds": 115.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "No, um, no facial pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.34,
      "end_seconds": 118.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Is the room warm enough for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.25,
      "end_seconds": 120.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "It's perfect, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.89,
      "end_seconds": 124.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.69,
      "end_seconds": 127.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "No operations, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.04,
      "end_seconds": 130.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "I'll just check what's already recorded here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.43,
      "end_seconds": 132.29,
      "duration_seconds": 0.86,
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.01,
      "end_seconds": 154.3,
      "duration_seconds": 6.29,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Do you have any known allergies at all? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.74,
      "end_seconds": 157.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Yes, dust, it gives me sneezing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.66,
      "end_seconds": 162.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.13,
      "end_seconds": 181.37,
      "duration_seconds": 14.24,
      "text": "Right, for the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.78,
      "end_seconds": 187.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.88,
      "end_seconds": 195.0,
      "duration_seconds": 7.12,
      "text": "I have eczema, for two years. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.68,
      "end_seconds": 197.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.86,
      "end_seconds": 205.75,
      "duration_seconds": 6.89,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, uh, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.53,
      "end_seconds": 209.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "What medicines are you taking at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.32,
      "end_seconds": 215.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.88,
      "text": "Um, I take hydrocortisone cream, when needed for the eczema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.09,
      "end_seconds": 218.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "So, how long have you been on it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.37,
      "end_seconds": 220.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "For nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.95,
      "end_seconds": 227.1,
      "duration_seconds": 5.15,
      "text": "Right, bear with me, I need to finish this line in the notes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.33,
      "end_seconds": 243.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Okay, continuing. Right, are you comfortable? Do you want some water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.96,
      "end_seconds": 249.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "Well, yes, some water would be nice, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.55,
      "end_seconds": 254.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.12,
      "end_seconds": 258.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Now I'm going to check this part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.68,
      "end_seconds": 275.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Chest is clear, no wheeze."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 276.87,
      "end_seconds": 277.57,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.48,
      "end_seconds": 295.45,
      "duration_seconds": 13.97,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together. Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.82,
      "end_seconds": 306.99,
      "duration_seconds": 10.17,
      "text": "Yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.73,
      "end_seconds": 311.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. My working impression is allergic rhinitis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 313.16,
      "end_seconds": 315.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Is this going to go away?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.55,
      "end_seconds": 332.11,
      "duration_seconds": 15.56,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like allergic rhinitis, but I'd like to confirm. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had sneezing fits for about three months, and no facial pain or loss of smell."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 335.16,
      "end_seconds": 337.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.8,
      "end_seconds": 341.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Let me make a quick note of that before I forget."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 342.16,
      "end_seconds": 342.86,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 353.68,
      "end_seconds": 362.07,
      "duration_seconds": 8.39,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Let's get an allergy test, for allergic rhinitis. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 362.55,
      "end_seconds": 364.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Okay, you know, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 366.04,
      "end_seconds": 386.92,
      "duration_seconds": 20.88,
      "text": "Let's use levocetirizine, 5 milligrams, at night, for two weeks. That's for allergy symptoms. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it. Let's use fluticasone nasal spray, 50 micrograms, one spray each side daily, for four weeks. That should help with allergic rhinitis. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 387.85,
      "end_seconds": 409.08,
      "duration_seconds": 21.23,
      "text": "Keep the windows closed in the early morning and wash the bedsheets weekly in hot water. Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle. Please take the tablets with food so they don't upset your stomach. Please don't sit on it if the symptoms get worse. That's the point to get seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 410.01,
      "end_seconds": 411.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Okay, I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 412.26,
      "end_seconds": 414.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Let's review you in a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 415.37,
      "end_seconds": 416.07,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 417.47,
      "end_seconds": 421.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "Just to confirm, what are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 423.06,
      "end_seconds": 433.88,
      "duration_seconds": 10.82,
      "text": "So, I take the levocetirizine, 5 milligrams, at night and take the fluticasone nasal spray, 50 micrograms, one spray each side daily. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 434.29,
      "end_seconds": 438.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Take care, and don't hesitate to call if anything changes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 440.25,
      "end_seconds": 443.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Nothing more from me, doctor, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 444.68,
      "end_seconds": 445.47,
      "duration_seconds": 0.79,
      "text": "Alright, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}